          "content": "| Number of wickets | 20 - 60 | 60 - 100 | 100 - 150 | 150 - 250 | 250 - 350 | 350 - 450 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Number of bowlers | 7 | 5 | 16 | 12 | 2 | 3 |",
